(card "exp:D-R2-4_blacklist_stack_quad" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:D-R2-4_blacklist_stack_quad"
  :body "---\nnav: 30\ntype: experiment\nid: D-R2-4_blacklist_stack_quad\nshort_name: blacklist_stack_quad\ntitle: \"D-R2-4 — default admit ∖ {lc_48h==2 ∪ open_3min ∪ low pre_amt q10 ∪ crowd≥4}\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: d\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_d__blacklist_default_admit]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.2257\ntrain_trade_count: 154\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8312\ntrain_sharpe: 7.1762\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0591\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0679\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.0113\ntest_trade_count: 10\ntest_sharpe: 1.7363\ntest_win_rate: 0.5\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0117\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: test_fail\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [blacklist, cross_source, timing_filter]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/d, round/r2, axis/blacklist, axis/cross_source, axis/timing_filter, status/falsified, outcome/test_fail, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# D-R2-4 — default admit ∖ 4-stack blacklist\n\n> **TL;DR** —— D 队 stack 顶点：在 D-R2-3 (3-stack) 上再叠 crowd≥4，砍到 154 笔。train NAV 2.23 已掉到 anchor 水平；**test NAV 1.01, sharpe 1.74, win 50%** —— 整个 vault **test 上最惨的 case 之一**。再次证伪 \"default-admit + N-stack blacklist\" 路线，stack 越多越崩。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 在 D-R2-3 stack (lc_48h==2 + open_3min + low_pre_amt_q10) 上再砍 crowd≥4（同 ticker 同方向 ≥4 个 echo）。\n- 假设：crowd≥4 = 严重过度拥挤 → reversion 已耗尽，强制砍。\n- 实测：crowd≥4 + 前 3 条 stack 互相 mask + train→test 漂移，test 上 win 50% (vs anchor 75%) —— 砍中过多 train-time profitable leg。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/scripts/round_2_runner.py`\n- 步骤：D-R2-3 stack ∪ drop legs with crowd≥4。\n- 输出 154 笔（vs D-R2-3 171, vs D-R2-1 214）。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 全部 blacklist component 都 past-only (lc_48h / pre_amt_5min / crowd-counting all past-only)。\n- `#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.2257 | 154 | 7.18 | 83.1% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0591 ± 0.068 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | **1.0113** | 10 | **1.74** | **50.0%** | -1.17% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **-0.237 (FAIL HARD)** | -10 | -5.41 | **-25.0pp** | -0.64pp |\n\ntest sharpe 1.74 / win 50% —— vault 最差测试表现之一。\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score nominal = 0，但 test win 50% / sharpe 1.74 是非常强的 falsification signal。\n- count_pass=True nominal，但 test trade_count 10 已远低于 anchor 20，**统计置信度极低**。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]]\n- **inherits_failure_mode**: D-R2-3 hold-out 崩盘 + 进一步 amplified\n- **also_validates**: [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R10-4__blacklist_stack_3]] anti-pattern (相同 stack 越多越崩 pattern)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (D-R2-4)\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/output/cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (D-R2-4 last row test_nav 1.011)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **vault 反例库金牌**: D-R2-4 是 \"**default-admit + N-stack blacklist** stack 越多越崩\" pattern 最强证据。下次任何 sub-agent 看到这条 axis 应直接绕开。\n- 推测机理：每条 blacklist train-fit identifiable bad leg 不到 5%；stack 4 条互相耦合，砍掉的 trade 在 hold-out 上有非随机 overlap，导致 statistical power 雪崩。\n- replacement strategy：**sizing axis (H 系列)** 在同 default-admit pool 上的表现远优于 blacklist (H-R3a-2 train 2.77, 虽然 test 1.17 也输, 但比 D-R2-4 sharpe 6.55 vs 1.74 高 ~4x)。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-4__blacklist_stack_quad.md"
